OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing talks of 'most tragic of days
OL,4,Aimaginable' as he meets survivors of
OL,5,AAberfan disaster 60 years on
OL,6,
OL,7,FMair Morgan, the last surviving teacher
OL,8,Fat the school, still remembers having
OL,9,Fto identify the children who died
OL,11,FAn official inquiry found the National
OL,12,FCoal Board was responsible for the
OL,13,Fdisaster, but no-one has ever been
OL,14,Fprosecuted
OL,16,FOn the anniversary, King Charles, Queen
OL,17,FCamilla and the Prince of Wales laid
OL,18,Fwreaths at a memorial garden that
OL,19,Fstands on the site of the school, and
OL,20,Fjoined survivors, bereaved parents and
OL,21,Fother members of the community
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/41
